      'Implemented a three-tier post-training pipeline specifically designed for TPU constraints, combined with sophisticated data engineering and iterative reward shaping.',
    solutionDetails: [
      'Tier-1 (SFT - Supervised Fine-Tuning): Trained the model on ~50,000 carefully curated examples formatted with strict <reasoning> tags. Built the foundation for structured reasoning syntax across 5 domains: Coding, Science, Math, General Reasoning, and Long-Context reading comprehension.',
      'Tier-2 (GRPO - Generalized Reward Policy Optimization): Replaced memory-heavy PPO with GRPO, which eliminates the Critic by estimating baseline from group means. Implemented iterative rule-based reward function with Format Gates (tag validation), Correctness checks (exact-match for math/code), and Safety Guards (penalizing empty reasoning and repetition).',
      'Tier-3 (Self-Distillation): Generated 4 candidates per prompt using the Tier-2 model, applied strict quality gates (only 10-15% passed), and merged retained examples back into Tier-1 data for final SFT pass.',
      'Dynamic KV-Cache Bounding: Implemented intelligent token bounding that calculates maximum generation length based on real-time KV-cache capacity, prompt length, and safety margins - preventing OOMs while maximizing reasoning space.',
      'Data Engineering Excellence: Curated 50K corpus from Sagi, Nvidia, and DeepSeek R1 sources. Ensured zero data leakage between tiers by using completely non-overlapping validation sets. Balanced 10K examples each across 5 reasoning domains.',
      'Infrastructure Optimization: Used bfloat16 precision (native TPU support), LoRA targeting q_proj/v_proj/k_proj/o_proj to minimize memory, and static XLA computation graphs to eliminate recompilation overhead.',
    ],
